        "FERRIS: Can you tell me a bit about yourself, Colin? How long have you lived round Boresfield?",
        "SWAYNE: Grew up round here, near the old Critchley works. [pause] Hard, I suppose. My dad died when I was young. Nine. My mum did her best after, with the three of us, but it wore her down over the years.",
